OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm not sure how King Charles
OL,4,Awould feel about being replaced by Tom
OL,5,AJones on our money'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I'm not going to rule anything in or
OL,8,Fout other than the picture of Tom
OL,9,FJones, which won't be on there, I'm
OL,10,Fafraid."
OL,12,FAs Rhys Phillips is set to become the
OL,13,Ffirst Welshman in history to have his
OL,14,Fsignature appear on UK banknotes, he
OL,15,Fadmits he would like to see his
OL,16,Fhomeland represented on the currency.
OL,18,FBut - even as the Bank of England's
OL,19,Fnewest chief cashier - he knows there
OL,20,Fare limits.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
