OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm not sure how King Charles
OL,4,Awould feel about being replaced by Tom
OL,5,AJones on our money'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile he joked about the possibility of
OL,8,Fadding a Welsh dragon, daffodil or Sir
OL,9,FTom Jones to the new banknotes, he had
OL,10,Fto rule out the latter.
